# Keycloak requests for the REST Client extension. No secrets in this file.
# To call protected endpoints, run `bb token <username>` (or `bb token scheduler`) in a
# terminal and paste the result into @token below. Demo users: see tools/realm.clj.

@kc = http://localhost:8080
@realm = pulse
@token =

### OpenID Connect discovery document
GET {{kc}}/realms/{{realm}}/.well-known/openid-configuration

### Signing keys (JWKS) used by the API to verify tokens
GET {{kc}}/realms/{{realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/certs

### Readiness (management interface)
GET http://localhost:9000/health/ready

### User info for the pasted token
GET {{kc}}/realms/{{realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/userinfo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
